{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22040","headline":"反鲍明远白头吟 · 白居易","name":"反鲍明远白头吟","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"炎炎者烈火，营营者小蝇。\n火不热贞玉，蝇不点清冰。\n此苟无所受，彼莫能相仍。\n乃知物性中，各有能不能。\n古称怨恨死，则人有所惩。\n惩淫或应可，在道未爲弘。\n譬如蜩鷃徒，啾啾啅龙鹏。\n宜当委之去，寥廓高飞腾。\n岂能泥尘下，区区酬怨憎。\n胡爲坐自苦，吞悲仍抚膺。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_22040.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_22040","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}